================================================================================================================
1. EPISODE ANATOMY -- every gated run on the QQEW rows
================================================================================================================
contrib = sum over the run's days of log(1+gate) - log(1+live) in pp (the realized gain incl. vol-target scaling);
QLD-leg = sum of log(1+QLD leg) over the run (what a 100% QLD holder would have made); QQQ = same for QQQ.
exit = the effective state the parent D episode went to; to-exit = sessions from the run's END to that change;
A<=60 / EF<=60 = sessions from the run's end until eff first reaches A / E-or-F (within 60), '-' = not reached.

40 gated runs, 124 days, inside 23 distinct D episodes (of 71 D episodes on these rows).  Sum of run contributions +84.5pp; total gate-live log difference over all rows +83.1pp (residual -1.4pp is path/rebalance effects outside the runs).  Live return summed over gated days -86.1pp; QLD-leg summed -98.1pp.

